      "Native smoke interactions passed on the recorded Android emulator. Other devices and all failure paths are not covered.",
      "Original/candidate screenshot comparison was not configured; visual quality is not verified.",
      "[follow-up] Terminal acknowledgement is stored separately from session completion. In GroveViewModel.finish(), the database commits before terminalResult is written to SharedPreferences; process death between those writes can preserve the earned tree but lose its unacknowledged completion feedback. Persist pending result acknowledgement atomically with completion and test recovery across that boundary.",
      "[follow-up] GroveDao.writeState() deletes and reinserts the entire task/session/tree history for each mutation, while repository snapshots reload all history. This is functional for the demonstrated MVP but increases work as the forest grows. Prefer targeted transactional updates and measure representative larger histories before making release-performance claims.",
      "[follow-up] Recorded device verification covers API 33 on one emulator. API 35 edge-to-edge behavior, large font scaling, and compact landscape layouts with the keyboard still need targeted device checks. The supplied source uses compatible inset consumption and bounded scrolling; these remaining checks are verification limits, not demonstrated layout defects."
